00:08:34,880 --> 00:08:36,760
难道你不觉得有什么不对吗
Nothing about that sounds wrong to you?

181
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:39,640
做蛋糕的傻子定价这么低
It's not our fault that the idiot who makes the cupcakes

182
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:40,680
又不是我们的错
doesn't know their worth.

183
00:08:42,340 --> 00:08:44,260
我就是做蛋糕的那傻子
I'm the idiot who makes the cupcakes.

184
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:46,720
我才知道嘛
New information.

185
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:48,780
这肯定不行
That's stupid.

186
00:08:48,780 --> 00:08:51,060
谁会花七块买我的蛋糕啊
No one would pay $7 for one of my cupcakes.

187
00:08:51,060 --> 00:08:53,899
你确定吗 看这...
Really? 'Cause...

188
00:08:58,500 --> 00:09:00,260
果然有遗传你爸弄钱的基因啊
Well, at least we know you're not adopted.

189
00:09:04,140 --> 00:09:05,900
你怎么会沦落到来布鲁克林打工
So how'd you even end up in Brooklyn?

190
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:08,200
我去招工网站
Oh, I went on monster.com.

191
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:09,860
输入 上东区的人[富人区]
Typed in "place where nobody

192
00:09:09,860 --> 00:09:11,900
这辈子绝对不会去的地方
from the Upper East Side would ever go, ever,"

193
00:09:12,340 --> 00:09:13,740
就出现这家店了
and this diner came up.

194
00:09:15,500 --> 00:09:17,700
这里治安差 穿高级皮衣
You can't wear a fancy leather jacket outside

195
00:09:17,700 --> 00:09:18,340
铁定会被抢
in this neighborhood.

196
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:19,460
反着穿 露出丑的那面
You have to turn it inside out.

197
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:22,800
皮草 算了 再翻回来吧
Fur. Cool. Turn it back.

198
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:27,540
你住哪儿呀
So where do you live?

199
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:30,340
我家大宅被银行没收查封了
Our townhouse was taken and bolted up by the bank, so...

200
00:09:31,400 --> 00:09:33,020
我需要表达一下同情吗
Is this where I'm supposed to feel sorry for you?

201
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:35,140
我是不想逼你啦
I mean, I don't want you to,

202
00:09:35,680 --> 00:09:37,780
不过正常的好人都会同情的
but just so you know, a well-adjusted person would.

203
00:09:40,040 --> 00:09:41,060
我是没同情心的坏人
I'm dead inside.

204
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:44,400
是人都看得出来
You make that pretty obvious.

205
00:09:46,140 --> 00:09:48,320
好吧 我要去市中心的朋友家了
Anyway, I'm just gonna stay in the city with a friend.

206
00:09:48,880 --> 00:09:51,020
我就住附近
I live a couple of blocks that way.

207
00:09:51,940 --> 00:09:53,160
我照理该陪你走去地铁站的
I'd walk you to the subway,

208
00:09:53,260 --> 00:09:54,640
不过我真的没这么好心
it's just that I don't want to.

209
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:56,960
完全理解
Got it.

210
00:09:58,400 --> 00:09:58,880
就这样吧
Okay.

211
00:10:10,826 --> 00:10:11,880
罗比
Robbie!

212
00:10:11,880 --> 00:10:13,380
放这么大声干嘛呢
Why is the music so loud?

213
00:10:15,670 --> 00:10:17,280
现在都凌晨三点了
It's 3:00 in the morning.

214
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:18,100
对不起嘛
I'm sorry.

215
00:10:20,560 --> 00:10:21,700
原谅你吧 你们在干嘛呢
It's cool. So what are you doin'?

216
00:10:23,260 --> 00:10:24,400
乐队在练习呢
The band's practicing.

217
00:10:25,740 --> 00:10:27,160
怎么没看到乐器呢
But you're not playing any instruments.

218
00:10:27,900 --> 00:10:29,300
这是我们独门秘技
Yeah, that's how we practice.

219
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:30,860
听着别人的音乐
We, like, listen to other good music,

220
00:10:30,860 --> 00:10:31,660
然后在自己脑海演练
and play it in our head.

221
00:10:33,900 --> 00:10:35,080
这好比不能弹的秘密
It's like the secret.

222
00:10:36,980 --> 00:10:38,940
是吗 我也有个秘密要跟你们说
Well, I have a secret for you guys.

223
00:10:39,180 --> 00:10:39,700
给我滚出去
Get out!

224
00:10:42,860 --> 00:10:44,460
-伙计们先走吧 -好的
- Uh, you guys better go. - We should go.

225
00:10:44,980 --> 00:10:46,799
抱歉了 我还得做小蛋糕呢
Sorry guys, I still have to make the cupcakes.

226
00:10:46,799 --> 00:10:50,766
干嘛自己做 去店里买一个不就得了
Cupcakes? For why? You can just buy 'em at the store.

227
00:10:52,660 --> 00:10:54,920
起来再做吧 宝贝 现在是滚床单时间
You can do that in the morning, babe, come to bed.

228
00:10:55,100 --> 00:10:57,400
不行 我明早十点要到市中心
No, I can't. I have to be in the city by 10:00.

229
00:11:00,100 --> 00:11:02,460
好吧 给你三分钟
Fine. You can have three minutes.

230
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:08,020
好吧 看在八块腹肌的份上 给你八分钟
Fine, you can have eight, one for each ab.

231
00:11:14,260 --> 00:11:15,380
关门请注意
Stand clear of the closing doors.

232
00:11:23,060 --> 00:11:25,440
太好了 死前心愿又完成了一样
Well, I can cross that off my bucket list.

233
00:11:36,680 --> 00:11:37,200
我有电击棒
I have a taser!

234
00:11:40,840 --> 00:11:42,560
天啊
Oh, my God.

235
00:11:46,520 --> 00:11:48,820
真是万分抱歉
I am so sorry.

236
00:11:49,040 --> 00:11:51,700
我以为这只是粉红小电棒
I didn't think it would hurt so much. It's pink.

237
00:11:52,700 --> 00:11:53,960
我都要被电成炭粉了
It didn't feel pink.

238
00:11:55,040 --> 00:11:56,640
我刚真不知道是你
I didn't know it was you.

239
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:58,120
我还以为自己被人强奸了呢
I thought I was being raped.

240
00:11:59,100 --> 00:12:01,280
摸你的手算个屁强奸啊
That's not what rape feels like.

241
00:12:04,100 --> 00:12:06,420
昨晚...你是在地铁上睡的吗
Did you... did you sleep on the subway?

242
00:12:07,100 --> 00:12:08,560
我没地可去
I had nowhere else to go,

243
00:12:08,560 --> 00:12:10,780
又不敢睡大街上
and I'm too afraid to sleep outside on the street.

244
00:12:11,460 --> 00:12:12,400
天啊 还真是娇生惯养
God, you're spoiled.

245
00:12:14,200 --> 00:12:15,480
下一站 格林中心
Next stop, Greenpoint.

246
00:12:17,920 --> 00:12:19,060
快拿好你的行李
Ugh, get your stuff, come on!

247
00:12:19,060 --> 00:12:20,340
我带你去我家吧 快点
I'll take you to my place, but hurry.

248
00:12:20,700 --> 00:12:22,180
我要三十分钟内赶回市中心
Cause I have to be in the city in 30 minutes.

249
00:12:25,980 --> 00:12:26,840
要打给我哦
Call me.

250
00:12:31,560 --> 00:12:33,860
天啊 你家进贼啦
Oh, my god, you've been robbed!

251
00:12:36,920 --> 00:12:38,520
我家本来就这样
This is how it always looks.

252
00:12:38,700 --> 00:12:40,840
天啊 你家真不错
Oh, my God, totally cute!

253
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:43,400
好了 我四点回来
All right, I'll be back at 4:00,

254
00:12:43,500 --> 00:12:44,500
然后我们一起上班
and we can go to work together.

255
00:12:44,780 --> 00:12:45,710
卫生间 卧室
Bathroom, bedroom,

256
00:12:45,710 --> 00:12:47,860
睡到四点才醒的男友 院子
boyfriend sleeps till 4:00, yard.

257
00:12:47,860 --> 00:12:49,220
你还有个院子
Oh, you have a yard.

258
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:53,040
感觉是放松吸毒两相宜的好地方
Looks like a really nice place to relax and do crack.

259
00:12:56,360 --> 00:12:57,060
那可不
It is.

260
00:12:59,240 --> 00:13:01,440
我得走了 不然我打工要迟到了
I gotta go, I'm gonna be late for my other job in the city.

261
00:13:01,600 --> 00:13:02,800
你打两份工吗
You have two jobs?

262
00:13:02,980 --> 00:13:05,520
对 还给一个曼哈顿社交女王看孩子
Yes, I babysit for a Manhattan socialite diva.

263
00:13:05,860 --> 00:13:06,880
现在又多了一个
Now I have a set.

264
00:13:11,440 --> 00:13:12,460
抱歉来晚了
Sorry I'm late.

265
00:13:12,840 --> 00:13:13,740
谢天谢地 你终于来了
Oh, thank God you're here,

266
00:13:13,800 --> 00:13:16,020
宝宝身上有一股地下臭水沟的味儿
there is a bridge and tunnel smell over by the babies

267
00:13:16,020 --> 00:13:17,720
快把我熏死了
that's stressing me out.

268
00:13:18,980 --> 00:13:20,780
应该是要换尿布了
Their diapers probably need to be changed.

269
00:13:21,140 --> 00:13:24,260
又要换啊 我肯定上午保姆才换了
Again? I swear, the morning nanny just did that.

270
00:13:24,780 --> 00:13:27,640
当妈可真不容易
Motherhood is for reals.

271
00:13:28,780 --> 00:13:30,800
麦克斯 我的推特密码是什么
Max, remind me, what's my Twitter password?

272
00:13:31,500 --> 00:13:32,480
“推特密码”
Twitter password.

273
00:13:32,820 --> 00:13:33,320
对啦
Yes!

274
00:13:35,500 --> 00:13:38,100
嗨 布莱德 安洁莉娜
Hi, Brad. Hi, Angelina.

275
00:13:38,300 --> 00:13:42,400
麦克斯 你也是家人 我有话想跟你说
Max, I need to tell you something because we're family.

276
00:13:42,660 --> 00:13:45,960
先给我拿瓶常温的水
Now get me room temperature water and come over here.

277
00:13:49,420 --> 00:13:52,520
我们是钱宁骗局的受害者
We are victims of the Channing Ponzi scheme.

278
00:13:53,540 --> 00:13:55,580
我 大卫 还有布莱洁莉娜
Me, David, and Brangelina.

279
00:13:57,380 --> 00:13:59,020
你们损失了多少
How much money did you lose?

280
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:01,220
握紧我的手
Hold my hands.

281
00:14:03,680 --> 00:14:04,280
分毫未损
Nothing.

282
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,520
不过吓死人家了
But it really scared me.

283
00:14:09,572 --> 00:14:11,276
帮我打开吧
Open that?

284
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:14,980
你认识卡洛琳·钱宁吗
So do you know Caroline Channing?

285
00:14:15,240 --> 00:14:17,520
不认识 她什么都没有了
No, but she lost everything.

286
00:14:18,060 --> 00:14:18,880
她一分钱都没有了
She has no money.

287
00:14:19,680 --> 00:14:21,240
你能想像没钱的滋味吗
Can you imagine having no money?

288
00:14:21,520 --> 00:14:24,220
我是指 穷的连钱都没有了
I mean, you wouldn't even have any money.

289
00:14:26,560 --> 00:14:27,880
金句快发推特啊
You should twit that.

290
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:31,560
树倒猴孙散 墙倒众人推
And no one will even talk to her.

291
00:14:31,560 --> 00:14:33,860
据说她为了找安身之地
I heard she went to six different friends' houses

292
00:14:33,860 --> 00:14:34,980
去敲了六个朋友的家门
for a place to stay,

293
00:14:34,980 --> 00:14:37,100
可他们都假装不在家
and they all had to pretend they weren't home.

294
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:39,200
-这太过分了 -对啊
- That's not cool. - Yeah.

295
00:14:39,940 --> 00:14:41,840
-真是不幸 -对啊
- That's really sad. - So sad.

296
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:43,720
听的都心碎了
Breaks my heart.

297
00:14:44,060 --> 00:14:46,180
当妈带孩子 人都多愁善感了
I guess motherhood has really opened me up emotionally.

298
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:48,960
麦克斯 我想抱抱我的宝宝
Max, I need to hold one of the babies,

299
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:50,080
帮我抱个过来
bring me one.

300
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:56,900
我要另一个 这个是次品
No, the other one. That's not the good one.

301
00:15:02,780 --> 00:15:05,480
-你好 -你好
- Hello. - Oh, hi.

302
00:15:05,980 --> 00:15:07,880
抱歉吵醒你了
Oh, I'm so sorry if I woke you up.

303
00:15:09,580 --> 00:15:12,280
-你是谁啊 -麦克斯的朋友
- Who are you? - I'm Max's friend.

304
00:15:12,700 --> 00:15:14,100
这话你可别跟她说
Uh, don't tell her I said that.

305
00:15:14,180 --> 00:15:15,780
她要知道我自称是她的朋友
I have a feeling if she heard me call her my friend,

306
00:15:15,780 --> 00:15:16,580
她会冲过来杀我
she'd stab me.

307
00:15:17,820 --> 00:15:19,060
你在这干嘛呢
What are you doin' over there?

308
00:15:19,480 --> 00:15:20,720
洗我的制服
Just washing my uniform,

309
00:15:20,900 --> 00:15:22,300
让它变美美
trying to make it a little more cute

310
00:15:22,320 --> 00:15:23,500
洗去那层污垢
and a little less crusty.

311
00:15:24,460 --> 00:15:25,260
小心
Oh, watch out!

312
00:15:25,560 --> 00:15:27,320
抱歉 我的错
Oh! Sorry, oh, my...

313
00:15:27,440 --> 00:15:28,944
你有毛巾或抹布
Do you have a towel or a rag?

314
00:15:28,944 --> 00:15:30,654
-之类的吗 -没关系 我来搞定
-Or something? - No, I... I got it.

315
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:32,360
好吧
Oh, okay.

316
00:15:38,980 --> 00:15:40,060
在下罗比
I'm Robbie.

317
00:15:40,520 --> 00:15:41,500
在下不舒服
I'm uncomfortable.

318
00:15:42,620 --> 00:15:43,740
你害人家都湿了
You're getting me wet.

319
00:15:44,260 --> 00:15:45,140
正有此意
That's the point.

320
00:15:46,640 --> 00:15:47,720
你是麦克斯的男友
You're Max's boyfriend.

321
00:15:47,920 --> 00:15:48,500
没关系的
It's cool.

322
00:15:49,080 --> 00:15:50,120
不 有关系
No, it's not.

323
00:15:50,660 --> 00:15:51,640
走开 卖肉男
Back up, Jersey shore.

324
00:15:54,940 --> 00:15:56,320
你真可悲
You're pathetic,

325
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:58,760
而且还是被一个无家可归
and that's coming from someone who's homeless

326
00:15:58,760 --> 00:16:01,000
无衣可换的人说
and wearing white after a labor day.

327
00:16:08,880 --> 00:16:10,160
姐见过身材更好的
And I've seen better.

328
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:13,180
才怪 你骗人
No, you haven't.

329
00:16:20,640 --> 00:16:22,100
你怎么没等我
Hey. Why didn't you wait for me?

330
00:16:22,140 --> 00:16:23,320
不是说好一起过来的吗
I thought we were coming over together.

331
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:26,720
我想早点来把番茄酱"联姻"起
Oh. Um, I wanted to get here early to marry the ketchups.

332
00:16:28,860 --> 00:16:31,560
今天我听说了你的惨况
Listen, I heard something really upsetting about you today.

333
00:16:31,720 --> 00:16:33,400
他怎么说的 说我投怀送抱吗
What did he say, that I came on to him?

334
00:16:34,720 --> 00:16:35,360
"他"是指...
Him who?

335
00:16:36,520 --> 00:16:36,980
没啥
Nothing.

336
00:16:43,700 --> 00:16:44,520
你是说罗比 对吧
Him, Robbie?

337
00:16:45,880 --> 00:16:47,220
这事与我无关
It's none of my business,

338
00:16:47,220 --> 00:16:49,580
但我觉得那家伙跟你配不上
but you deserve better than that guy.

339
00:16:51,060 --> 00:16:52,500
对 这事的确与你无关
Yeah, it is none of your business.

340
00:16:53,320 --> 00:16:55,680
唉 我刚刚对你起了一丝怜悯之情
Ooh, I was just starting to feel sorry for you.

341
00:16:56,380 --> 00:16:58,980
我是说 你可以找个更好的
I'm just saying, you're worth more than that.

342
00:16:59,200 --> 00:17:00,980
是吗 我该相信你的话吗
What, I'm supposed to believe you about this?

343
00:17:01,520 --> 00:17:03,300
你连简历都作假
The person who lied on their resume,

344
00:17:03,300 --> 00:17:05,080
还用蛋糕赚差价 你就是个大骗子
and lied about the cupcakes... you're a liar.

345
00:17:06,020 --> 00:17:08,380
-我是想帮你啊 -那好吧
- I'm just trying to help. - You know what?

346
00:17:08,440 --> 00:17:10,480
既然你什么都懂
Since you seem to know so much about everything,

347
00:17:10,580 --> 00:17:12,260
干嘛不带着你的沃顿学位
why don't you take your wharton degree,

348
00:17:12,260 --> 00:17:14,780
跟可笑的外套 找一个能收留你的地方
and your ridiculous coat, and figure this all out yourself.

349
00:17:15,060 --> 00:17:17,860
-麦克斯 等等 -瞧
- Max.Max, wait. - Oh, look,

350
00:17:17,860 --> 00:17:20,240
对街的拱廊之火乐队演唱会刚结束
The Arcade Fire concert just let out across the street,

351
00:17:20,260 --> 00:17:20,960
祝你好运
good luck with that.

352
00:17:21,940 --> 00:17:23,680
她会回来的吧
She's coming back, right?

353
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:25,040
这满屋子的顾客
She's not gonna leave me here alone

354
00:17:25,040 --> 00:17:27,040
她不会丢下我一个人的 对吧
with a restaurant full of people?

355
00:17:27,540 --> 00:17:29,200
我就这么跟你说吧
Let me put it to you this way.

356
00:17:29,540 --> 00:17:31,400
你就跟晚上在施瓦辛格家
You might as well be a night maid

357
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:33,080
落单的女佣一样
at the Schwarzenegger house.

358
00:17:34,700 --> 00:17:36,700
要被狠操一顿了
You got screwed.

359
00:17:44,495 --> 00:17:46,170
-爽 -太爽了
- Oh. - Oh, yeah.

360
00:17:46,340 --> 00:17:47,620
爽死我了
That feels so good.

361
00:17:48,240 --> 00:17:49,780
把铃鼓换来这个位置
Now put your tambourine around it.

362
00:17:53,020 --> 00:17:54,620
亲爱的 我回来了
Hi, honey, I'm home.

363
00:17:57,540 --> 00:17:59,840
在我下班前滚蛋
I want you gone by the time I get back.

364
00:18:00,760 --> 00:18:02,360
宝贝宝贝 听我解释
Babe! Babe, I can explain.

365
00:18:03,360 --> 00:18:04,580
你回家太早了嘛
You weren't supposed to be home.

366
00:18:06,840 --> 00:18:08,740
人家说你配不上我
People say I deserve better than you.

367
00:18:08,920 --> 00:18:10,840
谁 那个金发妞吗
Who? That blonde girl?

368
00:18:10,980 --> 00:18:12,420
她懂个屁 就会瞎说
She doesn't know what she's talkin' about.

369
00:18:12,940 --> 00:18:14,760
人家是沃顿毕业的
She went to Wharton

370
00:18:15,300 --> 00:18:16,360
还去过瑞士呢
and Switzerland.

371
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:28,700
快看快看
Yo, yo. Look at that.

372
00:18:29,160 --> 00:18:31,600
那妞儿干起活来比史蒂芬·霍金
That girl is workin' harder than Stephen Hawking

373
00:18:31,960 --> 00:18:33,600
扣袖口还努力呢
tryin' to put in a pair of cufflinks.

374
00:18:37,400 --> 00:18:38,720
来 我来帮你
Here, let me help you with that.

375
00:18:38,960 --> 00:18:39,860
我不要人帮
I don't need any help.

376
00:18:40,940 --> 00:18:42,280
每个人都有需要帮忙的时候
Everyone needs help sometimes.

377
00:18:48,060 --> 00:18:49,600
你们上错菜了
This isn't what I ordered.

378
00:18:51,780 --> 00:18:52,820
她叫卡洛琳
This is Caroline.

379
00:18:53,380 --> 00:18:54,680
她可能会下错单
She may have gotten your order wrong,

380
00:18:54,700 --> 00:18:56,380
但她起码有些事情没做错
but she does get some things right.

381
00:19:02,800 --> 00:19:03,460
谢谢
Thank you.

382
00:19:03,860 --> 00:19:05,320
不 是我要谢谢你
No, thank you.

383
00:19:07,040 --> 00:19:08,080
你到底看上那家伙哪点
What'd you see in that guy, anyway?

384
00:19:09,080 --> 00:19:10,760
他这里的肌肉不错
He had these muscle thingies.

385
00:19:10,840 --> 00:19:11,740
-那里呀 -是啊
- Oh,those things? - Yeah.

386
00:19:13,700 --> 00:19:15,000
我不知道那里怎么叫
I don't know what those are called,

387
00:19:15,020 --> 00:19:16,320
但是好女孩看了就会意乱情迷
but they make smart girls stupid.

388
00:19:17,720 --> 00:19:18,320
麦克斯
Max!

389
00:19:18,860 --> 00:19:21,520
还以为今晚见不到你的小翘臀呢
I thought your tight ass wasn't coming in tonight,

390
00:19:21,520 --> 00:19:23,700
我的心都快碎了
and my heart broke in half.

391
00:19:24,880 --> 00:19:26,000
奥列格
You know what, Oleg?

392
00:19:27,180 --> 00:19:28,440
这话我爱听
I needed that.

393
00:19:34,329 --> 00:19:35,794
如果
So I...

394
00:19:38,160 --> 00:19:40,820
你要找地方住的话 咱俩可以当室友
I need a roommate, if you wanna crash.

395
00:19:41,660 --> 00:19:44,600
真不是我说 地铁都比你家干净
Not gonna lie, the subway's cleaner than your couch.

396
00:19:48,600 --> 00:19:50,600
我好像对你有些好感了
I just felt myself starting to like you.

397
00:19:50,900 --> 00:19:52,780
真的吗 我真觉得我们可...
Really? Because I really feel like we could...

398
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:53,800
我就知道纯属错觉
I knew that wouldn't last.

399
00:19:55,500 --> 00:19:56,400
走吧
Come on.

400
00:19:57,660 --> 00:19:59,020
明天我们去市里
Tomorrow we can go into the city

401
00:19:59,020 --> 00:20:00,140
把你剩下的东西搬回来
and get the rest of your stuff.

402
00:20:00,700 --> 00:20:01,680
全部都锁起来了
Everything's locked up.

403
00:20:03,360 --> 00:20:05,140
没有一样你喜欢的东西是可以拿回来的吗
What, you have nothing that you care about that we can get?

404
00:20:05,920 --> 00:20:07,320
好像还真有一样
Well, there is one thing.

405
00:20:09,760 --> 00:20:12,300
居然没人拦我们 真是奇了怪了
The weirdest thing is that nobody stopped us.

406
00:20:14,680 --> 00:20:16,100
把它养在这里
I'm gonna save a fortune,

407
00:20:16,100 --> 00:20:18,040
比养在马厩里省钱多了
keeping him here instead of in the stables.

408
00:20:19,480 --> 00:20:22,580
什么时候想到这养马大计的
When did you put this whole horse-in-my-yard thing together?

409
00:20:23,220 --> 00:20:24,100
这就是我
I can't help it.

410
00:20:24,220 --> 00:20:25,980
只要有机可乘 我绝不让它溜走
I see an opportunity, and I make it happen,

411
00:20:26,080 --> 00:20:26,940
比如你的纸杯蛋糕
like with your cupcakes.

412
00:20:28,340 --> 00:20:29,740
关我的小蛋糕啥事
Like what with my cupcakes?

413
00:20:30,600 --> 00:20:32,740
听好了 开一家蛋糕店
Ready? To open a bake shop,

414
00:20:32,840 --> 00:20:34,840
只需要二十五万启动资金来
all we need is 250 grand start-up money,

415
00:20:34,840 --> 00:20:36,440
租店面 和买一些基本设备
for the real estate, and the basic equipment...

416
00:20:36,840 --> 00:20:37,880
是嘛
Yeah. Oh.

417
00:20:38,720 --> 00:20:40,840
-二十五万就够了吗 -对
- 250 grand,that's all? - Yeah.

418
00:20:40,840 --> 00:20:42,800
我去星巴克的时候
Did freakin' Chestnut here kick you in the head

419
00:20:42,800 --> 00:20:43,700
你的脑子让栗宝给踢了吗
while I was in Starbucks?

420
00:20:44,820 --> 00:20:45,620
听我说完
Hear me out.

421
00:20:45,820 --> 00:20:47,060
要是我们两人同时打两份工
If we both worked two jobs

422
00:20:47,060 --> 00:20:48,360
一周进账两千块
and made $2,000 a week,

423
00:20:48,360 --> 00:20:50,760
我们就可以在一年后开蛋糕店了
we could open a cupcake business in a little over a year.

424
00:20:51,220 --> 00:20:53,500
过去两天我们赚了三百八十七块
In the past two days, we've made $387,

425
00:20:53,800 --> 00:20:54,680
这是个不错的开始
and that's a good start.

426
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:56,460
我们还能兼职别的工作赚外快呀
We can make extra money at other jobs,

427
00:20:56,460 --> 00:20:59,340
比如做公关 广告行政
like publicists, advertising executives...

428
00:20:59,340 --> 00:21:00,800
看门 运毒
janitors, drug mules.

429
00:21:03,260 --> 00:21:05,180
看来得先提升你的自尊
We really need to work on your self-esteem.

430
00:21:06,780 --> 00:21:07,220
所以说
So...

431
00:21:07,520 --> 00:21:09,880
你的美味小蛋糕 加上我的商科背景
You, cupcakes, me, business background,

432
00:21:10,180 --> 00:21:12,960
我们就等于成功 怎样
us, success. What do you think?

433
00:21:14,620 --> 00:21:16,000
你还有匹马
I think you have a horse.

434
00:21:17,220 --> 00:21:19,260
是我们有匹马
I think we have a horse.

435
00:21:21,980 --> 00:21:23,420
不要爱上我
Don't get attached.
